<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-David Jones up after ceo resigns.</title>
<headline>RTRS-David Jones up after ceo resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in upmarket retailer rose slightly in early Tuesday after its chief executive officer Chris Tideman resigned late on Monday.</p>
<p>At 10.20 (2320 GMT), David Jones shares were two cents up at A$1.73 with about 140,000 shares traded.  </p>
<p>&quot;The general feeling is that it is quite positive, but people are anxious to see who the replacement is,&quot; one Sydney-based retailing analyst said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
